note: For ROM wave data access the YMF278 (aka OPL4) relies on a separate Yamaha YRW801 2MB ROM chip. This 
ROM is NOT bundled with VGMPlay and must be supplied separately for the benefit of those songs that 
actually use it. In order for VGMPlay to use a respective separate ROM file it must be called "yrw801.rom"
and be placed in the configured resource-folder.

